Statement of Purpose

The OLE specification text is made available under CC BY 4.0 to:

1. Enable anyone to read, implement, adapt, and build upon the specification.
2. Allow implementers to publish compliant systems without requiring a license grant.
3. Allow researchers, standards bodies, and policymakers to reference, translate, and incorporate OLE concepts.
4. Require attribution so that the source and stewardship of the standard remain clear.

